I’m in the video game beta, as well, which is how this revelation&nbsp;came about.

If the video game is supposed to be&nbsp;true&nbsp;to the tabletop game, they should be played consistently. With that in mind, what is currently being ruled for the video game is an absolute nightmare to track and implement on paper.&nbsp;This leads me to believe that it either wasn’t intended to be that way, or it was a game design oversight, and I think it would at least be worth another glance from our wonderful game creators.

